OL,3,GNEWSATwo gyms to close for             
OL,4,Arefurbishment work                     
OL,6,FA pair of council-run gyms in          
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire will close for        
OL,8,Frefurbishment.                         
OL,10,FThe gym at Corby East Midlands         
OL,11,FInternational Pool will close at 17:00 
OL,12,FGMT on Sunday and reopen on 21         
OL,13,FDecember. The gym at Lodge Park Sports 
OL,14,FCentre in the town will close at 20:00 
OL,15,Fon 20 December and reopen on 9 January.
OL,17,FThe upgrades will include new          
OL,18,Fequipment, flooring and decor.         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
