OL,3,GNEWSATwo gyms to close for             
OL,4,Arefurbishment work                     
OL,6,FBrian Benneyworth, North               
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire Council's Reform UK   
OL,8,Fexecutive member for leisure, said it  
OL,9,Fwas part of the authority's "commitment
OL,10,Fto providing high-quality, inclusive   
OL,11,Fleisure facilities that support        
OL,12,Fhealthier and more active communities".
